# the slow version calls what the function calls as it is written and is entered by a jump out of the guard, in the place of the fast one: whoever covers the one frame covers either
# f1 = area, which has a guard and two versions
# RUN: plan units mechanisms=all
# CHECK: unit f1:Body (JSValue, Double) -> (JSValue) covered-by-callers
# CHECK: unit f1:SlowBody (JSValue, JSValue) -> (JSValue) covered-by-callers
# RUN(WITHHELD): plan units mechanisms=all-DirectCalls
# WITHHELD-NOT: covered-by-callers
# PROGRAM-OF: ../which-functions-have-a-parameter-guard.ir
